{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/extras/wall_bounce_2.gif?t=1747345304\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/extras/Physical_Combat_Header.png?t=1747345304\" /><br><br>Galactic Glitch is an Twin-Stick Roguelike Shooter with <strong>physics based combat</strong>. Use your grav gun and exploit physics, grabbing and slingshotting rocks and mines off the walls of the arena. Grab enemy rockets and fling them back in their faces, or even grab and launch enemies into each other!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/extras/divider.png?t=1747345304\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/extras/jump1.gif?t=1747345304\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/extras/Explore_Header.png?t=1747345304\" /><br><br>Explore, loot and fight your way through hostile space. Gain new abilities to unlock new paths, discover hidden secrets and blaze your own path.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/extras/divider.png?t=1747345304\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/extras/grab_throw_fancybeam_unlock_gate.gif?t=1747345304\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/extras/Fight_your_own_way_header.png?t=1747345304\" /><br><br>Smarts beats pure firepower in this game. As you craft a build for every run, utilizing the variety of weapons, powerups, and upgrades to create the ultimate destruction machine.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/extras/divider.png?t=1747345304\" /><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/extras/destroyBreaker1.gif?t=1747345304\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/extras/features.png?t=1747345304\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li><strong>2D Space-Roguelite</strong> - Experience exhilarating twin-stick shooter gameplay combined with the endless replayability of a rogue-lite and the heart-pounding challenge of permadeath<br>    </li><li><strong>Physics-based Combat</strong> - Wield a powerful gravity gun to manipulate the battlefield, hurl massive asteroids, and turn your enemies' own missiles against them<br>    </li><li><strong>Multi-Part Enemies</strong> - Strategically dismantle foes piece by piece, exploiting their weak spots while avoiding their heavily armored defenses<br>    </li><li><strong>Dynamic Exploration</strong> - Venture into a mysterious, glitched world of star systems, uncovering hidden secrets and valuable items as you chart your unique path<br>    </li><li><strong>Abilities and Items</strong> - Customize your approach with diverse upgrade paths in each run. Unlock new Powers and experiment with creative combinations to craft your ultimate build</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/extras/divider.png?t=1747345304\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Asteroid dodger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536620/a421589da18970a862cc11490dc6604da94c8655.jpg"},{"name":"Experienced worker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536620/ca2652aa1a91bef3e71544df00033bd160b12ac1.jpg"},{"name":"Abyssal Acrobat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536620/2d47d9ee3929f1cba26fe121713bc46644757bfe.jpg"},{"name":"Venom Virtuoso","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536620/a7e16a8ef91123fb9bad858a34f5a91250db00ec.jpg"},{"name":"Junkyard Juggernaut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536620/0c2d54207a1ffc921cc586f81dbb46e0cef8c396.jpg"},{"name":"I am the Leviathan!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536620/22f4cd4c2e760eb8aa93001652f98361117b50fb.jpg"},{"name":"Gear Head","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536620/a5d2c7df3b313aaf05624f825eca766ff071c222.jpg"},{"name":"Unbroken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536620/3ef4ad0f2d4383853827907ba3bf086e6032ab61.jpg"},{"name":"Singularity Savant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536620/ea1f4400f0b53ecac2848f296f6adf0a9e5d4269.jpg"},{"name":"I will break you!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536620/2c0605848442cb712ae67c717bbe4198899246a4.jpg"}],"total":67},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1536620?t=1747345304","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1536620?t=1747345304","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747345304","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1536620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747345304","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor